{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54596","headline":"兵要望江南 占虹霓第七（京本作「占虹第九」○十一首） 五 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占虹霓第七（京本作「占虹第九」○十一首） 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"虹入井，尽是败军情。\n或有（京本作「似」）鼠形营上现，忽然交战血成坑，防（京本作「勿」）撃保城营。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54596.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54596","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}